    "page_text": "\ue8b6\n\ue5cd\n\ue56c\nRestaurants\n\ue53a\nHotels\n\ue412\nThings to do\n\ue535\nTransit\n\ue54f\nParking\n\ue550\nPharmacies\n\ue573\nATMs\n\ue5d2\n\ue866\nSaved\n\ue889\nRecents\nCinestar Multiplex\n\ue32c\nGet app\n\ue413\nSee photos\nCinestar Multiplex\n\u0938\u093f\u0928\u0947\u0938\u094d\u091f\u093e\u0930 \u092e\u0932\u094d\u091f\u0940\u092a\u094d\u0932\u0947\u0915\u094d\u0938\n3.8\n(6,682)\nMovie theater\u00b7\ue934\nOverview\nReviews\nAbout\n\ue52e\nDirections\n\ue866\nSave\n\uf05f\nNearby\n\ue702\nSend to phone\n\ue80d\nShare\n\u00a0\n\ue0c8\nB-6, Central Spine Rd, near Alankar Plaza, Sector 2, Central Spine, Vidyadhar Nagar, Jaipur, Jaipur Nagar Nigam Area, Rajasthan 302039\n\ue14d\n\ue80b\nin.bookmyshow.com\n\ue89e\n\ue14d\n\ue0b0\n097850 30721\n\ue14d\n\ue0b0\n\uf186\nXQ7J+XH Jaipur, Rajasthan\n\ue14d\n\ue88e\n\u00a0\n\ue3c9\nSuggest an edit\n\u00a0\nPhotos\n\ue577\n1960 Photos\n\u00a0\n\ue145\nAdd photos & videos\n\u00a0\nAt this place\nBella ciao (kulcha and kitchen)\n4.6(11)\nIndian restaurant\nClosed \u00b7 Opens 11\u202fam\nShree shyam neurotherapy\n5.0(3)\nHealth consultant\nClosed \u00b7 Opens 9\u202fam Mon\nAARADHYA CREATIONS\nNo reviews\nClothing Shop \u00b7 Floor 0\nClosed \u00b7 Opens 10\u202fam\nReview summary\n\ue887\n5\t\n\n4\t\n\n3\t\n\n2\t\n\n1\t\n3.8\n6,682 reviews\n\u00a0\n\"Best \u0925\u093f\u090f\u091f\u0930 comfortable sheets,and staff behaviour is good and fast food is best\"\n\u00a0\n\"Very bad 3d view glasses in bed condition with scratches\"\n\u00a0\n\"Good place for family but not PVR like experience Okay for a small place\n\u00a0\n\ue560\nWrite a review\n\u00a0\nReviews\n\ue8b6\n\ue164\nSort\n\ue5ca\nAll\nrecliner seats\n12\nbudget-friendly\n32\nscreen quality\n25\n3d experience\n6\n+6\nCA Lokesh Kasat\nLocal Guide \u00b7 266 reviews \u00b7 356 photos\n\ue5d4\n\ue838\n\ue838\n\ue838\n\ue838\n\ue838\n4 days ago\nNEW\nCinestar Multiplex offers an okay experience if you are simply looking to catch a movie in the area, but there is definitely a lot of room for improvement. It is a very old building now, and it clearly shows its age throughout the premises. \u2026 More\n\ue8dc\nLike\n\ue80d\nShare\n\u00a0\n\u00a0\nAmit Gupta\nLocal Guide \u00b7 69 reviews \u00b7 122 photos\n\ue5d4\n\ue838\n\ue838\n\ue838\n\ue838\n\ue838\n2 months ago\nRecently I went to watch Spider-Man in 3D, and seriously, I regret selecting this place. \ud83d\ude13 The AC was not working, and I just waited for 1\u20131.5 hours for the movie to end so I could go outside. The smell was also coming inside the hall, \u2026 More\n\ue8dc\nLike\n\ue80d\nShare\n\u00a0\n\u00a0\nDr. Ashish Agarwal\nLocal Guide \u00b7 27 reviews \u00b7 170 photos\n\ue5d4\n\ue838\n\ue838\n\ue838\n\ue838\n\ue838\n3 months ago\nThe ticket prices are reasonable, and the seats are comfortable enough. The picture and sound quality are not very impressive, but they're decent considering the ticket price. Overall, it's a good option if you're looking for an affordable movie experience without expecting a premium-quality theatre.\n\ue8dc\nLike\n\ue80d\nShare\n\u00a0\nMore reviews (6,679)\n\u00a0\nAbout this data\n\ue88e\nYou're seeing a limited view of Google Maps. See more\n\ue314\nSign in\n\ue55c\n\ue145\n\ue15b\n\ue577\n\ue53b Layers\nMap data \u00a92026 IndiaTermsPrivacySend Product Feedback\n\t100 m ",
